{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-28","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to one another, the sum will also be prime to each of them; and, if the sum of two numbers be prime to any one of them, the original numbers will also be prime to one another.","book":7,"number":28,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.28","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.28/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":28,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","contentId":"euclid-7-28","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3ee28b2de86c5ca634a2122cdd2e0e80d8b26a46f0c7bc6dbca01342d4f4c31","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-28.statement","euclid-7-28.construction.1","euclid-7-28.proof.1","euclid-7-28.construction.2","euclid-7-28.proof.2","euclid-7-28.proof.3","euclid-7-28.proof.4","euclid-7-28.proof.5","euclid-7-28.proof.6","euclid-7-28.proof.7","euclid-7-28.proof.8","euclid-7-28.construction.3","euclid-7-28.proof.9","euclid-7-28.proof.10","euclid-7-28.proof.11","euclid-7-28.conclusion","euclid-7-28.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-28.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d02549940e0dc65847a3b69d258d960a9a2452a0b1c45b734a57f8eec86814b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to one another, the sum will also be prime to each of them; and, if the sum of two numbers be prime to any one of them, the original numbers will also be prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字是互素, 则每个数字的金额也是最主要数字;如果其中任何一个数字的数值是两个数字的平均值, 原来的数字也将是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bdc731aa2d3a186580ce013ab0498a1cb87220c05320f06e7e25e4e95c0a1d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two numbers AB, BC prime to one another be added; I say that the sum AC is also prime to each of the numbers AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"加上两个AB,BC,互素;我说,AC的金额也是AB,BC的每一个数字的首当其冲。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"888d41071934e7436ae0736d3ece8ac5be4ef9137c11b7295d2ba9e2c71be43c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if CA, AB are not prime to one another, some number will measure CA, AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果CA,AB不是互素, 某些数字是整除,CA,AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fee6ddcda880207e422d970c4b108b6c158c2775a98efe4eb5909c96736a70c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure them, and let it be D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除,然后D"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66d7e137d391a0c2e6371aac8af7384165d1b1defaf6cc8bd28ea4a9895a6102","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then D measures CA, AB, therefore it will also measure the remainder BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从那时起,D 整除 CA AB 名法官将同时完成其余的BC名法官的职务。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f1d6c5f5310ef5295c8a799ee6cae055235386809e92cec6a95cf7a35db402e","citations":["euclid-7-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures BA; therefore D measures AB, BC which are prime to one another: which is impossible. [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 BA; 因此,D 整除 AB, BC, 也就是互素: 这是不可能的。 [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c28c00efcf9ede9d2c70821dd610005f5d3b3a05b46347c530a643a1567b0626","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure the numbers CA, AB; therefore CA, AB are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,数字CA,AB,号码将不为整除;因此,CA,AB是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fdb56bea369dc6c152cb154ee813e802c01c79a23df3fc96749a07a3152c1b3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason AC, CB are also prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,AC,CB也是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f3e07cd5518bb33da5b2aba94d3da1814ba33ed82f2802df0a8e82ceb85f4cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CA is prime to each of the numbers AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CA是AB,BC中每个数字的首选。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc2db6314d6a697ec5c93d708b7b3d45c4d9211d81cd84506753aaf7c43b6360","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let CA, AB be prime to one another; I say that AB, BC are also prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CA,AB,互素;我说,AB,BC也是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8690209569b89482f5c4fe17bae374bcc1108cc034d704be0dace420c610b8fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if AB, BC are not prime to one another, some number will measure AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AB,BC不是互素, 某些数字是整除,AB,BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fee6ddcda880207e422d970c4b108b6c158c2775a98efe4eb5909c96736a70c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure them, and let it be D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除,然后D"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b3f8dc41dbb77f04c481cbcd3ff8af316b1b9020224c86ff18d0dbfac4983dde","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since D measures each of the numbers AB, BC, it will also measure the whole CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,D 整除 每一个AB,BC, 它将整除 整个CA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ebdeb8a8546c8108306cc56121b7ba6dc1f3ecea653e7ea477c6b6c2dc97698f","citations":["euclid-7-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures AB; therefore D measures CA, AB which are prime to one another: which is impossible. [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 AB; 因此,D 整除 CA,AB, 也就是互素: 这是不可能的。 [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af27ecb17103630825dcbb4567f7f55b87c422c90360b92912f6d873f484d33b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure the numbers AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,没有号码整除 AB,BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd292d6889b9a0ab6380bb0f326528b786c99239ede9e1c811b89649daa66563","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB, BC are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB,BC是互素。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-28.source","contentId":"euclid-7-28","revisionId":"euclid-7-28@raw-f3ee28b2de86c5ca","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3065cb569c0ed914123c69c6d9e1d655586a0085182e881dac1391a10f48ddd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.28/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.28\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-28:euclid-7-def-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-28"